E AX3013 1013-cast-form-value.ax:16:6-10 partial-application "partial application of `cast`: it takes 2 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`cast` takes 2 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"`cast`, `sizeof` and `alignof` are forms whose first argument is a type, not functions: there is nothing for a bare one to be" ?"write the value to convert after the type - `(cast Int e)` - or, for a function value, `(lambda (x) (cast Int x))`"
E AX3013 1013-cast-form-value.ax:20:6-12 partial-application "partial application of `sizeof`: it takes 1 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`sizeof` takes 1 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"`cast`, `sizeof` and `alignof` are forms whose first argument is a type, not functions: there is nothing for a bare one to be" ?"write the type it measures: `(sizeof Int)`"
